Package: specs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Yoav Nir <yoav@yoav.com>
Description: Command-line utility for parsing and re-arranging text input
 specs is a command line utility for parsing and re-arranging text input.
 It allows re-alignment of fields, some format conversion, and re-formatting
 multiple lines into single lines or vice versa.
 .
 This is a re-writing of the specs pipeline stage from CMS.
